#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-9/c-38/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah that’s fair."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-9/c-38/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It just seems like kind of a waste of time..."
