#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-9/c-38/40/c-1/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You think, I 'waste time'?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-9/c-38/40/c-1/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I give you <i>so</i> much to think about."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-9/c-38/40/c-2/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "JFC."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Look: you came around here and asked to spend time with me. So I graciously invited you to participate in my kickass activities."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But I don’t have to doomscroll with you."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "There’s plenty of other moderately attractive humans or concepts I could be doomscrolling with."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I mean, I should just text Abbie... she is super hot."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/32
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "She did things even porn won’t show in some states."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Abbie?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/c-39/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Abbie? She's The Unceasingly Empty Feeling of Abandonment."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-10/c-39/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Right up my alley."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you’re right. Go after her, not me."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-11/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah maybe go spend more time with Abbie."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-11/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you Doug... I just don’t wanna doomscroll!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-11/c-40/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Damn straight I am. I’m always right."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-11/c-41/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Oh I will."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-11/c-41/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "She might’ve blocked my number, but I’ll find her on Sharebucket."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-11/c-42/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Well, that’s stupid... But I hear ya."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Tell ya what. Maybe our interests aren’t 100% aligned... but that’s ok."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Lotta power couples famously were opposites."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-12/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It’s not the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-12/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-12/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s not?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-12/c-43/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "See the end of the world happens in 7.59 billion years when the sun engulfs the Earth destroying our planet and everything that ever existed."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m sorry... what?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So climate change doesn’t destroy us? Yay!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As long as it destroys Bakersfield."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-45/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It’s science. Look it up."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-46/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "No, I said the \"end of the world\" happens in 7.59 billion years."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-46/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "The \"end of humanity\" happens <i>a lot</i> sooner."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-46/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait how much sooner?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-47/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-47/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Kinda fucked up to single out one specific city you want obliterated."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-47/23/b/1
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I mean, damn... your own city?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-47/26/b/1
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Like, what’d Bakersfield do to deserve that?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-13/c-47/29
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But you do you I guess."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "What matters is: I’m hot — and you’re passably attractive — so I don’t wanna blow this up over nothing."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Especially since Abbie isn’t returning my texts."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Passably attractive\"?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You’re too kind."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thanks Doug."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gotta stop texting Abbie."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/c-48/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I mean yeah."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/c-48/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "For an animated meat puppet."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/c-49/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I am?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/c-49/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Thanks for the heads up. I’ll dial it back."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/c-50/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You like that huh? Well there’s a lot more where that came from."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/c-51/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Why? You tryin' to move in on my turf?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-14/c-51/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "No way. Go find your own concepts to share memes with."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-15/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Tell ya what: why don’t you come back around here later, and I’ll try to find us a new activity we both like. Cool?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-15/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’d really like that."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-15/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure whatever."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-15/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I recommend sudoku."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-15/c-54/17
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Let’s not get ahead of ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Anyway, I gotta go find some school children and explain to them that no matter what they do their parents will eventually entropy and die."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And the reverse is even worse - parents outliving their children!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Good shit, good shit."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh God."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, they were gonna learn it eventually."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s super cruel Doug."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/c-55/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Naw I don’t bring up God."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/c-55/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Don’t wanna give them false hope."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/c-56/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Exactly. You get it. I’m doing a benevolent service."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/c-57/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Cruel? I’m goin’ easy on them."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-16/c-57/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Hell I don’t even tell ‘em about the heat death of the universe until they’re seniors in high school."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-17/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And don’t worry if you can’t stop thinking about me tonight when you’re all alone in your bed."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-17/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "That’s totes normal. I tend to have that effect on people."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-17/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Oh and don't text me; I don't do \"clingy.\""
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter1/0/g-17/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Later, Dorkus."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/6
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "'Sup Dork."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/14
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Been seeing you around the house, adding more dateable objects to your stupid little chairem."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's a 'chairem'?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice! \"Chairem\". I'm totally using that!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, so what?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "If you have to ask you're not cool enough to have one."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Tryin' to inject a little culture here, god."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Wtf? Don't take that."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It was my idea first."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm using it. What are you gonna do about it?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You'd better be."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "If you're gonna run with that idea you'd better give me credit."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Sue."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/26/c-1/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I love suing."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-1/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Anyway."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It's stupid is all."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You do something new with your hair? It looks different."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thanks for noticing."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I finally upgraded to name brand shampoo!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope, same ‘ol hair on same ‘ol me."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shut up, dork."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-0/c-6/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Clever."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Well it looks like shit."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "In fact, it looks like you got your head stuck in a blender."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Anyway, you caught me in the middle of ruminating."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I ruminate a lot. It’s hella tight."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hard agree."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I don’t think so."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What were you ruminating about?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Sure you do, Dork."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Yeah well \"thinking's\" clearly not your strong suit."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I was ruminating about the Big Crunch. You know the Big Crunch, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it a delicious candy bar?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think my gym has one. It’s a machine for abdominals yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s a monster truck!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, of course."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Figured you'd try to make this about candy bars."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But it’s <i>way</i> worse for you than a candy bar."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Oh it’ll twist up your guts alright."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Not even close."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’m gonna have to deduct 2 Doug Points for that misfire."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I’m pretty sure it’s a monster truck."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Darn it!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait how many Doug Points do I currently have?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Are you still talking?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’m trying to instill some trademark existential dread here..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It's okay, you're still doing shit at dating me."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Back to the Big Crunch..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Why would keeping track be my job?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You came up with the whole concept!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, Doug."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You came up with being a big Dork."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And I bet you don't keep a dork tally on you."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Ah wait, you probably do actually."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Yeahhhh... okay?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "There's no Sorry Points."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-2/c-12/23/c-2/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Anyway, back to the Big Crunch..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "The Big Crunch is a theory in cosmology that suggests since the universe is currently expanding, it’s possible it’ll eventually run out of momentum."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And when it does run out of momentum, the forces of gravity will pull it back together. Like a giant rubber band suddenly contracting."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And if that happens, the universe will collapse back into a singularity. Like how it existed before the Big Bang."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Everything in the entire universe — and the universe itself — will cease to exist."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Poof! Nothing. Nada."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Sick huh?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s horrifying."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But humanity could still escape somehow, right?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/10/s/0 doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why are you telling me this?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/c-14/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Right? Good luck falling asleep tonight!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/c-14/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Sleep is basically practice for dying anyway if you think about it.."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/c-15/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Oh absolutely!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/c-15/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Just kidding. The entire universe would be crushed into nothingness."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/c-15/23
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It’ll be as if it never existed at all."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-3/40/c-16/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I dunno. For the lulz?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Anyway... enough about how everything you do is utterly meaningless no matter how desperately you attempt to rationalize it."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’ve got something lighter to share."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope so. You're terrible at sharing stuff."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s ok... I can handle the bleak stuff."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is what you’re sharing edible?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Tch."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/c-18/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Oh don’t worry, we’ll get right back to that regularly scheduled program. Promise."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-4/c-19/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "No?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Last time we chillaxed, I promised I’d find an activity we could both enjoy."
