#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right, you did!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not ringing any bells, but continue."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-5/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The word \"chillax\" fills me with existential dread."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-5/c-20/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Excitement looks terrible on you, just sayin'."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-5/c-21/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Okay well 'ding a ling' here we go."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-5/c-22/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Exactly. Why did you think I chose it?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "After putting in a bare minimum of effort, I think I found a slightly tolerable activity."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I really appreciate that."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Tolerable\" sounds fun!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-6/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You’re not even trying are you?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-6/c-23/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Course you do."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-6/c-23/21
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’m a stud and you worship my tight abs."
