#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-30/21/0/s/0 doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-30/21/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My name’s"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-30/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>You sure are, Dougie.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-30/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-30/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Woah... you sound just like her."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-30/21/c-1/18
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I could work with that."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-30/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Oh right, should have remembered that."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-8/c-31/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Whatever you say, Dork."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Way I see it, this is a great way for us to spend time together."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Potentially <i>a lot</i> of time together. If you catch my drift."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have no idea what you mean."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Was that an innuendo?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I don’t want to spend time with you?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-33/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Um... not really."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Don’t wanna spend time with me?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Haha, you’re funny!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/32
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Like, not funny like holiday layoffs."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/40
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But compared to the infinite, meaningless abyss that ultimately consumes us all... you’re funny."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holiday layoffs are funny?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Doug."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/48/c-0/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Hahaha... don't get me started."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/48/c-1/7 doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-14/c-46/7 doug_dread/doug_friend_return/0/c-0/7 doug_dread/doug_friend_return/0/c-2/23/c-0/31/c-0/13 doug_dread/doug_love_return/0/c-2/23/c-0/31/c-0/13 doug_dread/doug_realize_return/0/c-2/26/c-0/31/c-0/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "K."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-9/c-34/48/g-0/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But this was my point..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "See I’m currently down about 64 million dollars. Give or take a few million."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "So, we gotta get all that cash back or I’m gonna owe some real bad dudes a lotta money."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But I did some math, and I figure if we play roughly 100 million hours of sudoku we can definitely get all that crypto back."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "100 million hours?!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How many \"Doug Points\" will that get me?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who loaned you 64 million dollars?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-35/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "There an echo in here?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-35/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Yeah, 100 million hours."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-36/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I dunno... three? A billion? How many ya want?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-36/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A billion."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-36/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "100 seems fair."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-36/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just kidding. I’m not in this for the points."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-36/15/c-0/7 doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-36/15/c-1/7 doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-36/15/c-2/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Sure whatever."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-37/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I don’t really wanna get into it. But his name rhymes with Cravid Post."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-37/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait: David Most?! That’s crazy!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-37/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It’s funny. a lotta people spend a lotta money tryin’ to make me go away."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-10/c-37/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Never works though."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Anyway, enough talking. Talkings for losers."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "We’ve got 100 million hours of sudoku to play. It’ll be fun!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love it!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doesn’t really seem fun."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if we just talked instead?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-38/17
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Course you do, Dork; that’s why you keep comin’ back."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-38/25
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Daddy Doug knows exactly what you need. Glad we’re on the same page."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-39/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’m sorry... what?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-39/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, sorry! Didn’t mean anything by it."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-39/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It just seems like a waste of time."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-39/24/c-0/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "So you playing this with me or what?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-39/24/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep, I'm in!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-39/24/c-0/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No... I don't want to."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Talked? Didn’t you hear what I just said? About talking being for los-"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "<i>Oh right you're a loser how stupid of me</i>."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/32
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But sure... let’s talk."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/40
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Share with me your rainbow hopes and lollipop dreams oh magical Regent of the Gumdrop Kingdom!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/48
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "God you’re so needy."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/56
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "If that ass wasn't so frickin' tight I’d drop you so fast."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually my official title is \"Sovereign Overlord.\""
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don’t think I’m <i>that</i> needy."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Yeesh. Is that what you call flirting?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "This: \"Look at me I’m so adorkable because I’m scared of actual sexuality\"?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/23
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "It’s cringe as hell. I’m deducting massive \"Doug Points\" for that."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Easy come easy go."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How many \"Doug Points\" do I have now?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "UGH. Don’t apologize! That just makes you more pathetic."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-1/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I dunno. Negative 50 trillion probably."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-11/c-40/64/c-2/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Well let’s not tire that l’il brain out with all that thinking, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Look, I’m tryin’ real hard here to meet you halfway."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You’ve got a lotta positive qualities."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You’re not that annoying — you’re available — and your bod is halfway decent for a writhing pile of anthropomorphic meat."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But you’ve got an awesome, super swole opportunity in front of you and let’s be real: you’re kinda massively blowing it."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m sorry! I’ll do better!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Of course you will. You’d be kinda stupid not to."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/21
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And I know you’re not stupid. I’ve seen inside your brain."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No it’s ok. I’m stupid. I’m at peace with that."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...you’ve seen inside my brain?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I wasn’t gonna say anything."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/c-1/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "But listen what’s important is: your cheekbones are super high."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/c-2/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’m an abstract metaphysical concept. I’m not bound by the rules of the physical universe."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/c-2/23
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "So I can do cool things like walk through walls..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter2/0/g-12/c-41/29/c-2/31
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Or infest people’s neurons and poison their thoughts with relentless, unending horror."
