#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-5/c-18/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Oh well sure. But Vidbucket has 253,000 graphic car crashes."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-5/c-18/53/c-0/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Speaking of which, we really should start streaming..."
