#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-6/c-22/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Hope?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-6/c-22/21
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Wait is she here?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-6/c-22/29
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Have you talked to her?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-6/c-22/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? Hope who?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-6/c-22/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Nothing, nothing. Forget it."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-6/c-23/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You’re joking right?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Look. Talking's just not what I do. That’s not my deal."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I watch sick-ass vids of car wrecks and play poker and argue with white-knighting dweebs online."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And if you wanna hang with this smoldering smokeshow, you’re gonna have to love doing that shit too."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Forever."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
