#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-24/7
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Yeah Dork, f-f-f-forever."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-24/15
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Until the sun burns out — or I get bored — or I need to take a dump — whichever comes first."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-24/23
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "My lunch was really spicy so personally I know what I’d put my money on."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-25/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Hell yeah! That’s what I’m talkin’ about."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Waste of time?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "<i>Life</i> is a waste of time, Dork."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/35
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Everyone yaps endlessly about how \"precious\" their time is."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/43
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "How they wanna make sure they’re using it in a meaningful way. But that’s where they lose the plot."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/51
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "There’s no such thing as \"meaning.\" It’s a dumb BS idea humans invented to help them score."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/59
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You can’t waste time, ‘cause time is worthless and nothing matters."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/67
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "That’s it."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well that’s depressing."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well that sure takes a load off!"
