#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just disagree."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/c-0/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Sure. But that’s why they invented SSRIs."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/c-0/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And beer."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/c-1/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Glad I could help."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/c-2/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Shocking."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/c-2/21
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’m sure the meaningless, black void of existence will be very concerned about your opinion on this issue."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-7/c-26/75/c-2/29
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I’ll be sure to bring it up to him next time he’s wasted on my couch."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Now are you finished? ‘Cause I've got a long list of meaningless crap I gotta get to."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah I'm finished."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter3/0/g-8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like watching the car wrecks?"
