msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I-I’m not a worthless piece of crap!"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Are those... tears glimmering in those dark eyes?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Where is this even coming from? Why are you doing this?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I really thought we were hitting it off... making a real connection... and now you’re yelling at me and calling me names?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "God this is just like her all over again."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "And after I promised myself I’d never get in this position ever again..."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Her? Her who? Abbie?"
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "What? No, not Abbie. I don’t care about Abbie."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Look, I don’t wanna get into this with you."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_hope_ending/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "You obviously don’t give a shit about me — just like she didn’t — so just get out of here, ok?"
