#: doug_dread/doug_encounter4/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "I'll believe it when I see it."
msgstr ""

#: doug_dread/doug_encounter4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Doug"
msgid "Look, I-I don’t mean to be such a time-wasting dick. That’s just my deal, ya know?"
